{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report", "label": "Task 5 Report: Shared Behaviour Modules and Runtime Mount", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_behavior_porting_rules", "label": "Behavior Porting-Rules Table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Class methods (initClock, initForm) become `Behavior` consts taking root; this.cleanups becomes a local array; every path returns a disposer, including a no-op on early return."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_nav_dead_code_removal", "label": "Ruling 1: Nav Dead-Code Removal", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The darks/probe/onDark computation was assigned once and never read in the original, so it was dropped from nav.ts."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_stable_modules_reference", "label": "Ruling 2: Stable modules Prop Reference", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AgRuntime's effect depends on [modules]; a fresh array per render would tear down and remount every behaviour, so modules must be a module-level constant (documented, no memoisation)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_build_gate_gap", "label": "Missing npm run build in Task 4 Gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Task 4's gate was node --test + tsc only, so ESLint-in-build errors in vendored files went unnoticed until Task 5; ruled a plan defect and every later task adds the build to its gate."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_eslint_vendor_override", "label": "Scoped ESLint Override for Vendored Effects", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Disables ban-ts-comment and no-explicit-any only for lib/liquid-ether.ts and lib/stroke-text.ts; rejected global disable, ignoreDuringBuilds, re-annotating frozen code, and relocating to lib/vendor."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_disposer_error_isolation", "label": "Per-Disposer Error Isolation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Matches the original componentWillUnmount try/catch per cleanup so one throwing disposer (likely WebGL/GSAP teardown) cannot strand the rest."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_ast_ssr_check", "label": "AST-Based SSR Module-Scope Check", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/reports/task-5-report.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Indentation heuristic was defeated by a continuation-line window access; TypeScript AST walk skipping function-like nodes flags real module-scope window/document use. Known gap: hazards inside a module-scope IIFE are not flagged."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report", "target": "docs_superpowers_reports_task_5_report_behavior_porting_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "co